    - even requires /reload after joining a group
    - gives this error when it happens
        PetesDefensiveHistory.lua:194: attempt to index field 'items' (a nil value)
- get rid of external=enum { NOT, ANY, NOT_SELF}
    - can't get rid of this because freedom is not flagged EXTERNAL. instead,
      generalize the idea to "targets"
    - the only example of this is sac, which is better handled as a sac-specific
      logic layer, not a flag on EVERY ability in the database.
- revisit the comment about separating out externals in updateGroupData
